  m_text: 'How to Play:

    Place nature cards on the board to set yourself up for
    battle. Sacrifice nature cards to use industry cards. Be aware that nature cards
    use up saplings. The sapling/sacrifice cost is located at the bottom right corner
    of the card. You win oncer you defeat the opponent


    Close'
